IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `hpba-board`

-- Health Promotion Board Act 2001, ss 7, 9, 11(1)(g), 11(3), 12, 16, 18, 22, 31-33, 38-41 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_health-promotion-board-act-2001.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

`a former school nurse telling a parent about another child's screening result` MEANS Disclosure WITH
    `by a present or former member, officer, employee, agent or committee member` IS TRUE
    `of information obtained in performing duties` IS TRUE
    `for performing duties or functions` IS FALSE
    `lawfully required by a court` IS FALSE
    `required or allowed by a written law` IS FALSE

`an officer giving evidence under a court order` MEANS Disclosure WITH
    `by a present or former member, officer, employee, agent or committee member` IS TRUE
    `of information obtained in performing duties` IS TRUE
    `for performing duties or functions` IS FALSE
    `lawfully required by a court` IS TRUE
    `required or allowed by a written law` IS FALSE

`an officer passing a screening result to the school dentist for treatment` MEANS Disclosure WITH
    `by a present or former member, officer, employee, agent or committee member` IS TRUE
    `of information obtained in performing duties` IS TRUE
    `for performing duties or functions` IS TRUE
    `lawfully required by a court` IS FALSE
    `required or allowed by a written law` IS FALSE

`an officer reporting a notifiable disease as another Act requires` MEANS Disclosure WITH
    `by a present or former member, officer, employee, agent or committee member` IS TRUE
    `of information obtained in performing duties` IS TRUE
    `for performing duties or functions` IS FALSE
    `lawfully required by a court` IS FALSE
    `required or allowed by a written law` IS TRUE

`a parent repeating what the school told her` MEANS Disclosure WITH
    `by a present or former member, officer, employee, agent or committee member` IS FALSE
    `of information obtained in performing duties` IS TRUE
    `for performing duties or functions` IS FALSE
    `lawfully required by a court` IS FALSE
    `required or allowed by a written law` IS FALSE

